  "details": "In recent VRChat build, Audio Reverb Zone changed behaviour and no longer echo back self voice.\nAll voice testing world seems stop working.\nCurrently we can not test our voice by hearing echo.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/audio-reverb-zone-stopped-echoing-back-the-players-voice-in-recent-bulild\nWe need alternative method to test voice.\nEcho back voice test function is needed for check:\n* correct audio device is used.\n* not noisy.\n* not too loud and not too silent.\n* not splitted by VRChat's noise gate.\n* some effect correctly applyed (if used)\nAlmost voice chat applications (Skype, Discord, Teams, etc.) has echo/talk back voice test function.\nSo VRChat should have that I think.",
